wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He is finding his new work far more exciting.","start":31.88,"end":35.79,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-005","sourceId":"b2-035-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When he was driving along Catford Street recently, he saw two thieves rush out of a shop and run towards a waiting car.","start":37.42,"end":48.13,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-006","sourceId":"b2-035-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One of them was carrying a bag full of money.","start":49.93,"end":53.35,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-007","sourceId":"b2-035-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Roy acted quickly and drove the bus straight at the thieves.","start":54.9,"end":59.68,"score":0.948,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-008","sourceId":"b2-035-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The one with the money got such a fright that he dropped the bag.","start":60.67,"end":65.88,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-009","sourceId":"b2-035-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"As the thieves were trying to get away in their car, Roy drove his bus into the back of it.","start":67.32,"end":74.88,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-010","sourceId":"b2-035-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"While the battered car was moving away, Roy stopped his bus and telephoned the police.","start":76.14,"end":83.42,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-011","sourceId":"b2-035-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The thieves' car was badly damaged and easy to recognize.","start":84.82,"end":89.59,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-035-012","sourceId":"b2-035-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Shortly afterwards, the police stopped the car and both men were arrested.","start":91.32,"end":97.41,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
